Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:49.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:56.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
